{"from": "passage:mk-16-01", "type": "parallels", "to": "passage:mt-28-01", "note": "After the Sabbath the women come to the tomb; Mark's three women buy spices where Matthew's two 'came to see the tomb'."}
{"from": "passage:mk-16-02", "type": "parallels", "to": "passage:mt-28-01", "note": "The first day of the week; Mark 'very early... when the sun had risen' against Matthew 'as it began to dawn'."}
{"from": "passage:mk-16-03", "type": "parallels", "to": "passage:mt-28-02", "note": "The stone at the tomb's door."}
{"from": "passage:mk-16-04", "type": "parallels", "to": "passage:mt-28-02", "note": "The stone rolled back; Matthew's angel rolls it away amid an earthquake, Mark's women simply find it rolled back."}
{"from": "passage:mk-16-05", "type": "parallels", "to": "passage:mt-28-03", "note": "The angelic figure: Mark's young man in a white robe inside the tomb against Matthew's angel 'like lightning' outside, sitting on the stone."}
{"from": "passage:mk-16-06", "type": "parallels", "to": "passage:mt-28-06", "note": "'He has risen; he is not here. Behold the place where they laid him!'"}
{"from": "passage:mk-16-07", "type": "parallels", "to": "passage:mt-28-07", "note": "'Go, tell his disciples' - Mark adds 'and Peter' - 'he goes before you into Galilee; there you will see him.'"}
{"from": "passage:mk-16-08", "type": "parallels", "to": "passage:mt-28-08", "note": "The women leave quickly in fear; Matthew adds 'with fear and great joy' and an immediate report to the disciples, where Mark's women say nothing to anyone."}
{"from": "passage:mk-16-09", "type": "parallels", "to": "passage:mt-28-09", "note": "An appearance to women at/after the tomb (longer ending); Mark names Mary Magdalene alone, Matthew the two Marys taking hold of his feet."}
{"from": "passage:mk-16-14", "type": "parallels", "to": "passage:mt-28-17", "note": "The eleven see the risen Jesus (longer ending: at table in Jerusalem; Matthew: on a mountain in Galilee, 'but some doubted')."}
{"from": "passage:mk-16-15", "type": "parallels", "to": "passage:mt-28-19", "note": "The commission: Mark's 'go into all the world... preach' against Matthew's 'make disciples of all nations, baptizing them in the name...'."}
{"from": "claim:mk-16-01-08-spices-tomb", "type": "mentions", "to": "person:mary-magdalene"}
{"from": "claim:mk-16-01-08-spices-tomb", "type": "mentions", "to": "person:salome-disciple"}
